"steamid": "76561198053185508", "personaname": "Bagheera", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198053185508/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 856, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 856, "last_played": 1454915249, "avatar": "787dd092e6d3a65adabeebfb7ac1064cd8b6425b"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game has much potential, but is completely unforgiving to new players in the game. Online play is a joke with most games consiting of one high or two high level vets speed running and leaving the rest of the team behind to die in the swarm. Would not recommend this game at all simply because of the unfriendly nature of the established community.", "timestamp_created": 1357371600, "timestamp_updated": 1495418110, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3450775", "author": {"steamid": "76561198022965391", "personaname": "Pepperstrats", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PepperStrats/", "num_games_owned": 233, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 6075, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5954, "last_played": 1367910000, "avatar": "dcc842540aede4b5e7d0963bd59ce22c7c406802"}, "language": "english", "review": "Beautiful, addicting, short-lived game. Will always remember", "timestamp_created": 1357334691, "timestamp_updated": 1357334691, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "987574", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983747962", "personaname": "Mithadon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mithadon/", "num_games_owned": 425, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 2980, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2827, "last_played": 1403397461, "avatar": "4e0c168809880cbc376671600565db0ce3ab6c0d"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10\n\nAlien Swarm is a fantastic sci-fi top down co-op adventure. Gather your fellow space marines and embark on a journey of heroics and alien obliteration. The campaign is too short, and the user made maps I've tried were not too interesting, but there are five difficulties (brutal is definitely brutal, and you'll need to make good use of a full squad), and speedrunning will keep you busy for many hours! \nI think it has to be the best free to play on Steam.", "timestamp_created": 1357326353, "timestamp_updated": 1385428895, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}